      "id": "b000016",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 25,
      "end_line": 29,
      "raw": "- Scene-graph visualization helpers were removed from the runtime window set. This directory now only contains\n  user-facing application windows and onboarding/trial surfaces.\n- `Onboarding.qml`, `OnboardingContent.qml`, and `TrialStatus.qml` now route visible window geometry through LVRS\n  `gap`, `radius`, `stroke`, and `scaleMetric(...)` helpers instead of local pixel literals.\n  page, avoiding the `/onboarding` route flip while reusing the shared onboarding content surface.\n",
      "items": [
